# Environment Variables for Web3 Agent Skills

Copy to `.env` and fill in your API keys.

```bash
# Blockchain RPC (Alchemy recommended)
ALCHEMY_ETH_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
ALCHEMY_POLYGON_URL=https://polygon-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
ALCHEMY_ARB_URL=https://arb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
ALCHEMY_BASE_URL=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
ALCHEMY_OPT_URL=https://opt-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
ETHEREUM_RPC_URL=
SOLANA_RPC_URL=

# DeFi
THE_GRAPH_API_KEY=

# NFT
RESERVOIR_API_KEY=

# Price Feeds
COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# Compliance
CHAINALYSIS_API_KEY=

# IPFS
PINATA_JWT=
```

Never commit `.env` with real keys.
